<title>USA: Western National Corp Q4 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Western National Corp Q4 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					   Quarter Ended	Year Ended</p>
<p>					   December 31	 December 31</p>
<p>					 1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> 1. Operating revenues	 $193.4   $178.4   $730.0   $695.9</p>
<p> 2. Operating earnings (a)     28.4	2.0    101.3     69.5</p>
<p> 3. Special after-tax charge</p>
<p>     in 1995			 0.0    (21.0)     0.0    (21.0)</p>
<p> 4. Operating earnings excluding</p>
<p>     special charge		28.4     23.0    101.3     90.5</p>
<p> 5. Realized investment gains</p>
<p>     (losses) (b)		  0.0    (23.2)    (1.9)   (62.2)</p>
<p> 6. Net income (loss)	  $28.4   ($21.2)   $99.4     $7.3</p>
<p>Per Common Share:</p>
<p> 7. Weighted average shares</p>
<p>     outstanding		  70.1     62.7     64.9     62.5</p>
<p> 8. Operating earnings (a)   $0.41    $0.03    $1.56    $1.11</p>
